  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simazhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simazhi:p001:m0000" ref="xvn_8o9_kzw">東海沖王祗</persName>，字敬度，泰始九年五月受封。<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simazhi:p001:m0019" ref="b8p_82e_1d1">殤王</persName>薨，復以祗繼<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simazhi:p001:m0027" ref="12z_a2y_dwt">兆</persName>，其年薨，時年三歲。</p>
